put.summary:
Sets or replaces the logo (ADR 0059). The body is the file itself, a PNG, JPEG or WebP image of at most 256 KB and
2000 pixels a side, with its media type as the Content-Type. Needs If-Match with the version of the settings;
answers the settings with their new version.

CreditNoteApplicationDto.description:
One application of a credit note's credit to a bill, as the API returns it (BR-212, BR-213). `AppliedAtPosting` is
true for the application the credit note made to its own bill when it was posted, which cannot be reversed;
`ReversedAtUtc` and `ReversalReason` are null unless the application was reversed (ADR 0028).
